<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="RecipeHub Sequence Diagram" version="24.0.0">
  <diagram id="recipehub-sequence-publish" name="Sequence diagram">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="794" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="mermaid_code" value="sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as R&amp;D Specialist
    participant UI as :RecipeDetailPage (UI)
    participant API as :RecipesController
    participant Service as :RecipeService
    participant Repo as :RecipeRepository
    participant DB as :PostgreSQL (recipe_db)
    participant Redis as :RedisStreams (Broker)

    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Bấm nút &quot;Phát hành&quot; (Publish)
    activate UI
    UI-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/v1/recipes/{id}/versions/{vId}/publish
    activate API
    API-&gt;&gt;Service: PublishAsync(publicId, versionId, actor)
    activate Service

    Service-&gt;&gt;Repo: GetRecipeVersionAsync(publicId, versionId)
    activate Repo
    Repo-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM recipe_version WHERE public_id = @vId
    activate DB
    DB--&gt;&gt;Repo: RecipeVersion Entity (Status='draft')
    deactivate DB
    Repo--&gt;&gt;Service: version
    deactivate Repo

    Note over Service: Kiểm tra điều kiện phát hành [BR-01]

    alt FAIL BR-01: Thiếu nguyên liệu / bước SOP / Yield
        Service--&gt;&gt;API: throw ValidationException(&quot;At least 1 ingredient &amp; 1 step required&quot;)
        API--&gt;&gt;UI: 400 Bad Request (Validation Error)
        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị cảnh báo lỗi, giữ nguyên Draft để bổ sung
    else FAIL BR-04: Trạng thái hiện tại không phải Draft
        Service--&gt;&gt;API: throw ConflictException(&quot;Only a draft can be published&quot;)
        API--&gt;&gt;UI: 409 Conflict
        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Cảnh báo công thức đã phát hành là bất biến
    else PASS BR-01, BR-04 &amp; Quyền duyệt BR-05
        Service-&gt;&gt;Service: Set Status = &quot;published&quot;, PublishedAt = UtcNow
        Service-&gt;&gt;Repo: SaveChangesAsync()
        activate Repo
        Repo-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE recipe_version SET status='published', published_at=NOW()
        activate DB
        DB--&gt;&gt;Repo: Rows affected = 1
        deactivate DB
        Repo--&gt;&gt;Service: Task (Success)
        deactivate Repo

        Service-&gt;&gt;Redis: PublishAsync(AuditActivityEvent: &quot;recipe.published&quot;)
        activate Redis
        Redis--&gt;&gt;Service: XADD audit.activities.v1 OK
        deactivate Redis

        Service--&gt;&gt;API: RecipeDetailResponse (Status='published')
        deactivate Service
        API--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK (RecipeDetailResponse)
        deactivate API
        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Phát hành thành công, khóa form bất biến [BR-04]
        deactivate UI
    end" style="shape=mxgraph.mermaid;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="1120" height="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>